WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.158 --> 00:00:01.538
- Just hold the car seat steady.

00:00:01.538 --> 00:00:02.538
- All right.

00:00:04.139 --> 00:00:04.972
One step at a time.

00:00:04.972 --> 00:00:05.805
Let me know if you need anything.

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:06.638
- Yeah.

00:00:07.914 --> 00:00:11.015
(cheerful music)

00:00:11.015 --> 00:00:13.495
(groans)

00:00:13.495 --> 00:00:15.745
- She kinda looks like you.

00:00:17.075 --> 00:00:19.995
- She kinda looks like a raisin.

00:00:19.995 --> 00:00:22.315
Honey, can you help me up?

00:00:22.315 --> 00:00:25.615
Oh, they don't tell you
how painful this is.

00:00:25.615 --> 00:00:29.114
- You smell like you've had
some things happen downstairs.

00:00:29.114 --> 00:00:31.455
Let's get to the bottom of that, okay?

00:00:31.455 --> 00:00:32.288
Oh, wow!

00:00:33.434 --> 00:00:35.135
That's everywhere.

00:00:35.135 --> 00:00:35.968
(laughs)

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:36.801
That is--

00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:37.634
- Here you go.

00:00:37.634 --> 00:00:39.645
- You see this? It's a lot.

00:00:39.645 --> 00:00:42.812
- You're going to need that, actually.

00:00:46.745 --> 00:00:48.286
I can't do this.

00:00:48.286 --> 00:00:49.645
I'm going to ruin her life.

00:00:49.645 --> 00:00:52.941
- Honey, it's just a diaper rash.

00:00:52.941 --> 00:00:56.024
- I can't even change a diaper right!

00:00:57.483 --> 00:00:59.430
- Honey, I need help.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:01.180
Can you get my phone?

00:01:02.134 --> 00:01:03.537
- I'm gonna go get more diapers.

00:01:03.537 --> 00:01:05.197
- [Woman] You're in a robe.

00:01:05.197 --> 00:01:06.447
- It's alright.

00:01:10.894 --> 00:01:11.727
(baby crying)

00:01:11.727 --> 00:01:12.687
- Let me see,

00:01:12.687 --> 00:01:15.406
I can take the baby and you can lay down.

00:01:15.406 --> 00:01:16.905
Okay?

00:01:16.905 --> 00:01:18.250
No problem, okay.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.500
You're alright.

00:01:22.527 --> 00:01:24.194
It's been some time.

00:01:25.585 --> 00:01:27.293
I was thinking maybe you might wanna--

00:01:27.293 --> 00:01:28.126
- No.

00:01:31.981 --> 00:01:34.379
- Wow, that's your biggest blowout yet!

00:01:34.379 --> 00:01:36.129
It's very impressive.

00:01:43.819 --> 00:01:45.652
She is finally asleep.

00:01:46.879 --> 00:01:48.459
- I really miss her.

00:01:48.459 --> 00:01:49.659
- Yeah, me too.

00:01:49.659 --> 00:01:51.299
- It's been a crazy month.

00:01:51.299 --> 00:01:53.912
- Yeah, but it's the best kind of crazy.

00:01:53.912 --> 00:01:56.662
(cheerful music)

00:01:59.912 --> 00:02:02.079
(snoring)

00:02:06.381 --> 00:02:07.620
- I don't know how I'm gonna get up.

